# Trivy suppressions. Each entry needs a comment explaining why it is safe.

# undici 6.29.0 (denial of service; certificate validation bypass in its
# Agent) is the copy that npm bundles for node-gyp, in the npm that
# @semantic-release/npm brings with semantic-release: the release workflows
# load neither that plugin nor node-gyp, and install the packages without
# their scripts. A bundled copy moves with npm alone: the expiry makes Trivy
# report it again, until an npm bundles a fixed undici.
